// Every cell is state + trajectory with its source, vintage, licence (registry id), method and footprint. Cell values come from one
// reproducible evidence pipeline (scripts/evidence/*.py: one footprint per region, recorded inputs and hashes); a cell the pipeline
// could not reproduce carries value: null and a nullReason instead of a number. Labels are neutral band words from criteria[].bands
// plus a context phrase, never a rank. Nothing here is composite or scored: the site filters by thresholds and never sums criteria.
//
// Schema per value (built by cell() below):
//   { value, unit, vintage, label, source, sourceUrl, sourceId, method, footprint, retrieved, [scenario], trajectory, audit }

